Subject: Re: Nominal response model in MIRT
Message-ID: <B07vectS0gs.nwI9mhJmAQAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <B07vectS0gs.4WSC89oYAQAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
